: Blog\nL138: \nL139: July 07, 2026\nL140: #### Introducing Muse Image and Muse Video\nL141: \nL142: Muse Image follows instructions faithfully, edits with precision, composes from multiple references, and draws on Instagram for social context. Muse Video delivers exceptional visual fidelity with native audio support.\nL143: \nL144: July 07, 2026\nL145: \nL146: cite21†Learn More L147: \nL148: Blog\nL149: \nL150: April 08, 2026\nL151: #### Scaling How We Build and Test Our Most Advanced AI\nL152: \nL153: As we build more capable, personalized AI, reliability, security, and user protections are more important than ever.\nL154: \nL155: April 08, 2026\nL156: \nL157: cite24†Learn More L158: \nL159: Blog\nL160: \nL161: March 26, 2026\nL162: \nL163: #### Research\nL164: \nL165: #### Introducing TRIBE v2: A Predictive Foundation Model Trained to Understand How the Human Brain Processes Complex Stimuli\nL166: \nL167: March 26, 2026\nL168: \nL169: cite25†Learn More L170: \nL171: Blog\nL172: \nL173: March 10, 2026\nL174: \nL175: #### Open Source\nL176: #### Mapping the World's Forests with Greater Precision: Introducing Canopy Height Maps v2\nL177: \nL178: In partnership with the World Resources Institute, today we’re announcing Canopy Height Maps v2 (CHMv2), an open source model, along with world-scale maps generated with the model.\nL179: \nL180: March 10, 2026\nL181: \nL182: cite26†Learn More L183: \nL184: Blog\nL185: \nL186: April 06, 2026\nL187: \nL188: #### Computer Vision\nL189: #### How Alta Daily Uses Meta’s Segment Anything to Reimagine the Digital Closet\nL190: \nL191: April 06, 2026\nL192: \nL193: cite27†Learn More L194: \nL195: cite28†Next L196: \nL197: cite1†Meta AI L198: \nL199: cite1†Assistant L200: \nL201: cite2†Media Generation L202: \nL203: cite3†Vibes L204: \nL205: cite0†Muse L206: \nL207: cite0†Agent L208: \nL209: cite29†AI agents explained L210: \nL211: cite30†What is agentic AI L212: \nL213: cite31†Agentic AI e